ion New Zealand Manapou ki te Ao</h1>\n                            <p><p>We are the government agency dedicated to helping Aotearoa New Zealand realise the social, cultural and economic benefits of international education.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Create your free MaiENZ account to access ENZ services with a single sign-in.&nbsp;</p></p>\n                                \n                                    \n                                \n\n                                \n                                    \n                                \n                        </div><!-- end hero-text -->\n                    </div><!-- end col -->\n                </div><!-- end row -->\n            </div><!-- end hero -->\n        \n    </div><!-- end container -->\n</div><!-- end hero-wrapper -->\n\n    \n\n    \n        <div class=\"redirector-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row redirector\">\n            <div class=\"col-xs-12\">\n                <h5>Are you a student?</h5>\n                <ul style=\"display: flex; \">\n                    \n                        \n                            <li><a href=\"https://www.studywithnewzealand.govt.nz/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Do you want to study with New Zealand? Find out how.</a></li>\n                        \n                    \n                    \n                        \n                            <li><a href=\"https://naumainz.studyinnewzealand.govt.nz/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Are you a current or enrolled student? Visit NauMai NZ.</a></li>\n                        \n                    \n                </ul>\n            </div><!-- end col -->\n        </div><!-- end redirector -->\n    </div><!-- end container -->\n</div><!-- end redirector-wrapper -->\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"intro-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"intro-block\">\n                <div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-8\">\n                        <div class=\"intro-text\">\n                            <h2>Top stories</h2>\n                            \n                        </div><!-- end intro-text -->\n                    </div><!-- end col -->\n                </div><!-- end row -->\n            </div><!-- end intro-block -->\n        </div><!-- end container -->\n    </div><!-- end intro-wrapper -->\n\n    <div class=\"cards-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row cards\">\n            \n                <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-4\">\n                    \n                        <a\n                            href=\"https://www.enz.govt.nz/news-and-research/ed-news/latest-data-shows-continued-growth-in-international-enrolments\"\n                            target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n                        >\n                    \n                        <div class=\"card \">\n                            <img src=\"/assets/Uploads/0139-Studyinnewzealand-ThinkNEW.jpg\" alt=\"0139 Studyinnewzealand ThinkNEW\">\n                            <h3>Latest data shows continued growth in international enrolments</h3>\n                            <p>The ongoing recovery of the international education sector reflects sustained effort, with strong growth in enrolments, new data from ENZ shows.</p>\n                            <p><span class=\"card__button\">Read more</span></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                \n            \n                <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-4\">\n                    \n                        <a\n                            href=\"https://www.enz.govt.nz/news-and-research/ed-news/new-research-shows-new-zealand-is-a-topthree-study-choice-for-international-students\"\n                            target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n                        >\n                    \n                        <div class=\"card \">\n                            <img src=\"/assets/cards/Exp-enrolments-release-JPG.jpg\" alt=\"Exp enrolments release JPG\">\n                            <h3>New research shows New Zealand is a top\u2011three study choice for international students</h3>\n                            <p>New Zealand\u2019s international education brand is strengthening, with more prospective students ranking it among their top study destinations.</p>\n                            <p><span class=\"card__button\">Read more</span></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                \n            \n                <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-4\">\n                    \n                        <a\n                            href=\"https://www.enz.govt.nz/news-and-research/ed-news/david-downs-appointed-chief-executive-of-education-new-zealand-manapou-ki-te-ao\"\n                            target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n                        >\n                    \n                        <div class=\"card \">\n                            <img src=\"/assets/Uploads/David-Downs.jpg\" alt=\"David Downs\">\n                            <h3>David Downs appointed Chief Executive of Education New Zealand Manapou ki te Ao</h3>\n                            <p>Downs will take charge effective 2 June 2026 following the recent departure of Amanda Malu, who was appointed Secretary for Children and Chief Executive of Oranga Tamariki \u2013 Ministry for Children. </p>\n                            <p><span class=\"card__button\">Read more</span></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                \n                    <div class=\"clearfix visible-sm-block visible-md-block visible-lg-block\"></div>\n                \n            \n                <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-4\">\n                    \n                        <a\n                            href=\"https://www.enz.govt.nz/news-and-research/ed-news/international-education-drives-nz4-5-billion-economic-boost-as-sector-grows-with-strong-public-support\"\n                            target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n                        >\n                    \n                        <div class=\"card \">\n                            <img src=\"/assets/042_Studyinnewzealand_Universities.jpg\" alt=\"042 Studyinnewzealand Universities\">\n                            <h3>International education drives NZ$4.5 billion economic boost as sector grows with strong public support</h3>\n                            <p>New Zealand\u2019s international education sector continues its steady and balanced growth, contributing more than NZ$4.52 billion annually to the economy and enjoying enduring public support for international students.</p>\n                            <p><span class=\"card__button\">Read more</span></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                \n            \n                <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-4\">\n                    \n                        <a\n                            href=\"https://www.enz.govt.nz/news-and-research/ed-news/government-announces-international-education-going-for-growth-plan\"\n                            target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n                        >\n                    \n                        <div class=\"card \">\n                            <img src=\"/assets/445460-learn-new-every-day-campaign-image-web-version-1920px.jpg\" alt=\"445460 learn new every day campaign image web version 1920px\">\n                            <h3> Government announces International Education Going for Growth Plan</h3>\n                            <p>The New Zealand Government has today announced the International Education Going for Growth Plan.</p>\n                            <p><span class=\"card__button\">Read more</span></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                \n            \n                <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-4\">\n                    \n                        <a\n                            href=\"/maienz\"\n                            \n                        >\n                    \n                        <div class=\"card card--maienz\">\n                            <img src=\"/assets/cards/laptop-home.png\" alt=\"laptop home\">\n                            <h3>Introducing MaiENZ</h3>\n                            <p>Access ENZ&#039;s digital services with a single sign-in and discover your own personalised dashboard. </p>\n                            <p><span class=\"card__button\">Learn more</span></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                \n                    <div class=\"clearfix visible-sm-block visible-md-block visible-lg-block\"></div>\n                \n            \n        </div><!-- end row -->\n    </div><!-- end container -->\n</div><!-- end cards-wrapper -->\n\n    <div class=\"tabs-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row tabs-block\">\n            <div class=\"col-xs-12\">\n                <ul class='tabs'>\n                    <li class=\"news\"><a href=\"/home#tab1\">News</a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div><!-- end col -->\n        </div><!-- end row -->\n    </div><!-- end container -->\n</div><!-- end tabs-wrapper -->\n<div class=\"tabs-wrapper2\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row tabs-block\">\n            <div class=\"col-xs-12 news-block\" id='tab1'>\n                <div class=\"news-teasers-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        \n            <div class=\"row news-teaser\">\n                <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-2 news-teaser-date\">\n                    <p>25 June 2026 at 11:41\u202fam</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-8 news-teaser-content\">\n                    <p class=\"type\">Education Media Releases</p>\n                    <h4><a href=\"/news-and-research/ed-news/around-the-world-in-five-129\">Around the world in five\u202f </a></h4>\n                    <p>Education news stories from around the world.\u202f\u202f\u202f\u202f\u202f </p>\n                </div>\n            </div><!-- end news-teaser -->\n        \n            <div class=\"row news-teaser\">\n                <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-2 news-teaser-date\">\n                    <p>25 June 2026 at 11:04\u202fam</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-8 news-teaser-content\">\n                    <p class=\"type\">Education Media Releases</p>\n                    <h4><a href=\"/news-and-research/ed-news/from-the-acting-chief-executive-continuing-our-work-together\">From the Acting Chief Executive: Continuing our work together</a></h4>\n                    <p>As I pass the r\u0101kau to Chief Executive David Downs, I want to share that it has been an absolute privilege to support the sector through this important period..</p>\n                </div>\n            </div><!-- end news-teaser -->\n        \n            <div class=\"row news-teaser\">\n                <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-2 news-teaser-date\">\n                    <p>24 June 2026 at 2:17\u202fpm</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-8 news-teaser-content\">\n                    <p class=\"type\">Education Media Releases</p>\n                    <h4><a href=\"/news-and-research/ed-news/china-transnational-education-policy-update-what-it-means-for-new-zealand-education-providers\">China transnational education policy update: What it means for New Zealand education providers </a></h4>\n                    <p>China\u2019s latest policy briefing signals long-term continuity and stability for transnational education (TNE)</p>\n                </div>\n       